flowchart LR
    Client[Client] --> Peer[Direct Peer / Reverse Proxy]
    Peer --> API[REST API / Spring MVC]
    API --> Trust{Direct peer in trusted CIDR?}
    Trust -->|No: ignore forwarding headers| Direct[Use direct peer]
    Trust -->|Yes: validate bounded chain| Chain[Resolve first untrusted hop from right]
    Direct --> Effective[Normalized effective client]
    Chain --> Effective
    Effective --> Security[Spring Security / Login Protection]
    Security --> UseCases[Application Use Cases]
    UseCases --> Domain[Domain Model]
    UseCases --> Ports[Output Ports]
    Ports --> PostgreSQL[(PostgreSQL)]
    Ports --> Redis[(Redis)]
    Ports --> Kafka[(Kafka)]
    Kafka --> Consumers[Notification / Audit Consumers]
    API --> Observability[Actuator / Prometheus]
    Effective -. source + outcome only .-> Observability
